WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.000
What makes heat deadly? It is not only the temperature.

2
00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:10.300
Three things add up. Humid air. Hot nights. And many hot days in a row.

3
00:00:10.650 --> 00:00:15.390
And recorded deaths are a floor: many are never counted as heat deaths.

4
00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:19.890
Each major heatwave changed what came after.
